       "content": [
        {
         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "A hospital stores a sealed sample of iodine-131. Iodine-131 decays by beta-minus emission to xenon-131:"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "¹³¹₅₃I → ¹³¹₅₄Xe + e⁻ + ν̄"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The half-life of iodine-131 is 8.0 days. When the sample is delivered, the activity of the iodine-131 is 3.2 × 10⁵ Bq."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
